    "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: 'Jost', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"background: #3A4248; height: 104px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 56px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55;\">\n    <div>Questions? Call us: <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">+998 78 122 00 13</strong><br>Email us: <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">info@mosaic-insurance.com</strong></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap;\">The <span style=\"color: #F8D870;\">GOLD</span> plan</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0;\"></div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 0 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.15; color: #3A4248; text-wrap: balance;\">If you need an ambulance or a hospital</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 14px 56px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-top: 3px solid #5A626A; padding-top: 8px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Ambulance and urgent care</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2E3A46;\">If someone&#39;s condition suddenly gets worse, the plan pays for an ambulance: the team arrives, provides urgent care and takes the patient to hospital if needed.</p>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A626A;\">Covered</div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Team call-out</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Examination</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Rapid diagnostics¹</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Urgent care</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Transport to hospital</span></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-top: 3px solid #5A626A; padding-top: 8px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Emergency hospitalization</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2E3A46;\">When someone has to be admitted without delay, the plan pays for treatment to accepted medical standards, the hospital stay², meals, nursing care and medication.</p>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A626A;\">Covered</div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Consultations with any specialists</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Laboratory diagnostics</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Imaging and treatment</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #ECEDEF; color: #1B1F24;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9.5 L7.5 14 L15 4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A626A\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Intensive care</span></div></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A5B0C;\">Covered with limits</div>\n      <div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 3px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A68A00\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 2 A7 7 0 0 1 9 16 Z\" fill=\"#A68A00\"></path></svg><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1B1F24;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Hospital stay</strong> — up to 10 days</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 3px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A68A00\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 2 A7 7 0 0 1 9 16 Z\" fill=\"#A68A00\"></path></svg><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1B1F24;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Anaesthesia and surgery</strong> — in acute cases</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; border-top: 3px solid #9AA3AC; padding-top: 10px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">What inpatient care does not include</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2E3A46;\">Complex high-technology operations need to be planned separately, so they fall outside the plan:</p>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #EEF0F2; color: #3E4852;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4 L14 14 M14 4 L4 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7580\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Cardiac surgery³</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #EEF0F2; color: #3E4852;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4 L14 14 M14 4 L4 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7580\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Neurosurgery</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #EEF0F2; color: #3E4852;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4 L14 14 M14 4 L4 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7580\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Plastic surgery</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #EEF0F2; color: #3E4852;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4 L14 14 M14 4 L4 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7580\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Organ transplants</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #EEF0F2; color: #3E4852;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4 L14 14 M14 4 L4 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7580\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Reconstructive surgery⁴</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.25; background: #EEF0F2; color: #3E4852;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4 L14 14 M14 4 L4 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7580\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Angiography</span></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #3A4248; padding: 14px 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\">\n      <svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#E84030\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8 H24 V16 H32 V24 H24 V32 H16 V24 H8 V16 H16 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></path></svg>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #FFFFFF;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Life-threatening emergency?</strong> Call an ambulance on <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">103</strong> or contact MOSAIC INSURANCE GROUP&#39;s assistance service.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A5561;\">\n      <p>¹ Within the capability of the equipment carried by the ambulance.</p>\n      <p>² Ward conditions depend on what the admitting hospital can offer.</p>\n      <p>³ Including coronary artery bypass grafting.</p>\n      <p>⁴ Anastomoses, shunts and prostheses.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 0; width: 794px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6570;\">10</div>\n  <div data-legal style=\"position: absolute; left: 56px; right: 56px; bottom: 12px; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.3; color: #9AA3AC; text-align: left; pointer-events: none;\">GOLD 09/26 · © 2026 Mosaic Insurance Group JSC. All rights reserved. No part of this brochure may be copied or reused without written permission.</div>\n</div>",
    "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: 'Jost', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"background: #3A4248; height: 104px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 56px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55;\">\n    <div>Questions? Call us: <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">+998 78 122 00 13</strong><br>Email us: <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">info@mosaic-insurance.com</strong></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap;\">The <span style=\"color: #F8D870;\">GOLD</span> plan</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0;\"></div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 0 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: #3A4248; text-wrap: balance;\">What the plan does not cover</h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #2E3A46; text-wrap: pretty;\">Every health plan has exclusions — conditions and services it does not pay for. It is worth reading the list in advance.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: 26px; padding: 10px 56px 0;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">1</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Alcohol, drug and substance abuse and their complications, as well as injuries and illness sustained while intoxicated.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">2</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Radiation injuries, congenital anomalies, hereditary conditions, cerebral palsy, orthopaedic disorders and birth trauma.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">3</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Sexual dysfunction, infertility, impotence, IVF and insemination, sterilisation, gender reassignment, treatment of menopausal syndrome.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">4</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">AIDS, HIV, sexually transmitted infections (including TORCH) and their complications.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">5</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Heart and vascular disease requiring bypass, angioplasty or stenting and preparation for them — except emergency care for a newly diagnosed condition.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">6</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Transplants, implants, endoprosthetics, plastic and reconstructive surgery for cosmetic purposes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">7</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Pregnancy management, childbirth and termination — except emergency care following an accident.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">8</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Orthopaedic treatment of flat feet, deformed and ingrown nails (unless inflamed); crutches, prostheses and wheelchairs.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">9</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Deep mycoses, hair and nail conditions, demodicosis, chronic skin conditions (psoriasis, eczema, acne and others) outside a flare-up, alopecia.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">10</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Tuberculosis, sarcoidosis, cystic fibrosis, diabetes mellitus and their complications.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">11</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Hepatitis B, C, D and G and liver cirrhosis; hepatitis of other origin outside a flare-up.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">12</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">All cosmetology services and procedures, including weight correction.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">13</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Benign and malignant tumours.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">14</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Mental health disorders and conditions.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">15</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Chronic heart, liver and kidney failure.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">16</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Infectious and parasitic diseases — except acute respiratory infections and influenza.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">17</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Chronic conditions outside a flare-up, including medication; tests before planned surgery and planned hospitalization.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E4E6E8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">18</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Glasses and contact lenses, treatment of strabismus, glaucoma and cataract, vision correction; buying and repairing medical devices.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin: 10px 56px 0; background: #FDE7D3; padding: 12px 16px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">19</div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Which medicines are not paid for?</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\">Contraceptives; dietary supplements and homeopathy; cosmetic products; immunostimulants and immunosuppressants; chondroprotectors and statins; hepatoprotectors; glucose-lowering drugs; antidepressants and psychotropics.</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #1B1F24;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">One exception:</strong> vitamin D3, magnesium, vitamin B12 and folic acid are paid for when a doctor prescribes them on medical grounds and they are registered as medicines. Long-term medication is covered for up to 30 days.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 0; width: 794px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6570;\">11</div>\n  <div data-legal style=\"position: absolute; left: 56px; right: 56px; bottom: 12px; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.3; color: #9AA3AC; text-align: left; pointer-events: none;\">GOLD 09/26 · © 2026 Mosaic Insurance Group JSC. All rights reserved. No part of this brochure may be copied or reused without written permission.</div>\n</div>",
    "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: 'Jost', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"background: #3A4248; height: 104px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 56px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55;\">\n    <div>Questions? Call us: <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">+998 78 122 00 13</strong><br>Email us: <strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">info@mosaic-insurance.com</strong></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap;\">The <span style=\"color: #F8D870;\">GOLD</span> plan</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0;\"></div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 0 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.15; color: #3A4248; text-wrap: balance;\">Frequently asked questions</h1>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Who do I call at night or at the weekend?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">MOSAIC INSURANCE GROUP&#39;s assistance service — it works around the clock, including weekends and public holidays. A physician will advise you by phone and arrange care.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Can a doctor come to my home?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">Yes. If you are not well enough to travel to a clinic, a doctor will visit you at home. Lab samples can be taken there too.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Is planned hospitalization covered?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">No, only emergency admissions, when care cannot wait. In that case the plan pays for up to 10 days in hospital, treatment, meals and nursing care.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Can family members be insured?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">Yes. Employees&#39; family members receive every service in the plan except the corporate check-up, which is for employees only.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Which medicines does the plan pay for?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">Medicines and dressings for acute conditions, as prescribed by a doctor. Long-term medication is covered for up to 30 days. More on <span style=\"font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;\">p. 8</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Are chronic conditions covered?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">Care is paid for during a flare-up, unless the condition itself is excluded. Diabetes and hepatitis B and C, for example, are excluded.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 4px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">Q</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: #3A4248;\">Is pregnancy covered?</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #5A626A;\">A</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2E3A46;\">Pregnancy management and childbirth are not covered. The exception is emergency care following an accident.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 0; width: 794px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6570;\">12</div>\n  <div data-legal style=\"position: absolute; left: 56px; right: 56px; bottom: 12px; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.3; color: #9AA3AC; text-align: left; pointer-events: none;\">GOLD 09/26 · © 2026 Mosaic Insurance Group JSC. All rights reserved. No part of this brochure may be copied or reused without written permission.</div>\n</div>",
    "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #E8720F; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: 'Jost', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"height: 300px; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0;\"><img src=\"assets/img/team.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; display: block;\"></div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 56px 56px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.1; color: #FFFFFF;\">Find more answers.</h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; color: #FFFFFF; max-width: 600px;\">We are happy to walk you through the GOLD plan and help you find the right fit for your company.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; padding: 40px 56px 0;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 0 24px 0 0; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A626A;\">Phone</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">+998 78 122 00 13</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 0 24px 0 0; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A626A;\">Email</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">info@mosaic-insurance.com</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 0 24px 0 0; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A626A;\">Website</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">mosaicinsurance.uz</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 0 24px 0 0; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A626A;\">Address</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #3A4248;\">14 Elbek Street, Yashnabad district, Tashkent, Aviapark business centre</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"flex-grow: 1;\"></div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; height: 10px;\"><div style=\"flex-grow: 1; background: #90C850;\"></div><div style=\"flex-grow: 1; background: #F8D030;\"></div><div style=\"flex-grow: 1; background: #E84030;\"></div><div style=\"flex-grow: 1; background: #F08870;\"></div><div style=\"flex-grow: 1; background: #1088C0;\"></div><div style=\"flex-grow: 1; background: #007890;\"></div></div>\n  <div style=\"background: #3A4248; padding: 26px 56px 32px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px;\"><img src=\"assets/img/emblem.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 48px; height: 48px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: 'Gilroy', 'Jost', sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1;\"><div style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.06em;\">MOSAIC</div><div style=\"font-size: 9px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; margin-top: 4px;\">INSURANCE GROUP</div></div></div>\n    <p style=\"font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #FFFFFF; max-width: 390px; text-align: right;\">© 2026 Mosaic Insurance Group JSC. This material is for information only and is not a public offer. Cover is governed by the insurance contract and the plan documents.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div data-legal style=\"position: absolute; left: 56px; right: 56px; bottom: 12px; font-family: 'Fira Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.3; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); text-align: left; pointer-events: none;\">GOLD 09/26 · © 2026 Mosaic Insurance Group JSC. All rights reserved. No part of this brochure may be copied or reused without written permission.</div>\n</div>"
